#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-wayland-session.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-wayland-session.xml:112
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-wayland-session.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring lxqt-wayland-session"
msgstr "Configurando lxqt-wayland-session"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-wayland-session.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The session chooses from a pre-existing list of Wayland compositors to use. "
"While compositors like Hyprland and Niri can be used, the following uses the"
" recommended compositor <xref linkend=\"wayfire\"/>. Trying to just start "
"the session without configuration fails if labwc, another Wayland "
"compositor, is not installed. Each user will need to have a configuration. "
"Copy and edit a pre-existing configuration as a regular user to use the "
"recommended compositor for the session:"
msgstr ""
"A sessão seleciona a partir de uma lista preexistente de compositores "
"Wayland para usar. Embora compositores como Hyprland e Niri possam ser "
"usados, o seguinte usa o compositor recomendado <xref linkend=\"wayfire\"/>."
" Tentar apenas iniciar a sessão sem configuração falhará se labwc, outro "
"compositor Wayland, não estiver instalado. Cada usante precisará ter uma "
"configuração. Copie e edite uma configuração preexistente como um(a) usante "
"comum para usar o compositor recomendado para a sessão:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-wayland-session.xml:140
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv ~/.config/lxqt &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v /usr/share/lxqt/session.conf ~/.config/lxqt &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i '/\\[Environment\\]/a compositor=wayfire' \\\n"
"       ~/.config/lxqt/session.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv ~/.config/lxqt &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v /usr/share/lxqt/session.conf ~/.config/lxqt &amp;&amp;\n"
"sed -i '/\\[Environment\\]/a compositor=wayfire' \\\n"
"       ~/.config/lxqt/session.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/lxqt/desktop/lxqt-wayland-session.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now continue until <xref linkend=\"lxqt-post-install\"/> for completing the "
"setup."
msgstr ""
"Agora continue até <xref linkend=\"lxqt-post-install\"/> para completar a "
"configuração."

