#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The <application>lxqt-wayland-session</application> package contains the "
#~ "wayland based session manager for <application>LXQt</application>."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "O pacote <application>lxqt-wayland-session</application> contém o "
#~ "gerenciador de sessão baseado em Wayland para "
#~ "<application>LXQt</application>."

#, xml-text
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Window Managers other than <xref linkend=\"openbox\"/> may be used, e.g.  "
#~ "<xref linkend=\"xfwm4\"/>. Please note that <xref linkend=\"icewm\"/> is not"
#~ " a good substitute. <application>Fluxbox</application> does work, although "
#~ "in this context (with <xref linkend=\"lxqt-config\"/>), <xref "
#~ "linkend=\"openbox\"/> is better.  The configuration file "
#~ "<filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename> comes with many "
#~ "examples of Window Managers and the ones which are installed will appear in "
#~ "a drop down list of <command>lxqt-config-session</command>. For the ones not"
#~ " included in <filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename>, you "
#~ "can use <command>lxqt-config-session</command>'s \"search\" button, e.g. for"
#~ " <xref linkend=\"fluxbox\"/>, navigating through the file system until you "
#~ "can choose <command>fluxbox</command>."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Outros Gerenciadores de Janelas além do <xref linkend=\"openbox\"/> podem "
#~ "ser usados, por exemplo o <xref linkend=\"xfwm4\"/>. Por favor, observe que "
#~ "o <xref linkend=\"icewm\"/> não é um bom substituto. O "
#~ "<application>Fluxbox</application> funciona, embora nesse contexto (com o "
#~ "<xref linkend=\"lxqt-config\"/>), o <xref linkend=\"openbox\"/> seja melhor."
#~ " O arquivo de configuração "
#~ "<filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename> vem com muitos "
#~ "exemplos de Gerenciadores de Janelas, e os que estiverem instalados "
#~ "aparecerão em uma lista suspensa do <command>lxqt-config-session</command>. "
#~ "Para aqueles não incluídos em "
#~ "<filename>/usr/share/lxqt/windowmanagers.conf</filename>, você consegue usar"
#~ " o botão \"pesquisar\" do <command>lxqt-config-session</command>, por "
#~ "exemplo, para <xref linkend=\"fluxbox\"/>, navegando ao longo do sistema de "
#~ "arquivos até que consiga escolher <command>fluxbox</command>."

